<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσφάλλω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έσφηλα</span> (v. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lead astray, drive in baffled
				course,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅντινα πρῶτον ἄποσφήλωσιν ἄελλαι ἐς
					πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.320
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή . . σφας ἀποσφήλειε
			πόνοιο</span> lest he <i>balk</i> them <i>of</i> the fruits
			of toil, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.567
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cause to err,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				59.147
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in 
				Pass.
			, esp. in aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεσφάλην [ᾰ</span>], <i>to be
			balked</i> or <i>disappointed of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐλπίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be deprived of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρενῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					33.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				472
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					392
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσίας ἀρετῆς ἀπεσφαλμένοι</span>
			<i>mistaken as to</i> the nature of . ., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				950b
			</span></i>; <i>fail in reaching,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰταλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>make a mistake,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				26.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσφάλλεσθαι εἴς τι</span>”
				<i>go astray,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.392b
				</span></i>
			: rare in literal sense, <i>miss one's footing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσφαλεὶς ἐξ ὕψους ἔπεσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Per.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
